<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36386" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĭpĕrātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>peppered</i>, <i>seasoned with pepper.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">garum piperatum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acetum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 47, 5</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĭpĕrātum</span></b> ,
			i, n., <i>peppersauce</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cels.
				4, 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Apic. 3,
			14</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>peppery</i>, <i>pungent</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">piperata facundia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 5, 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">8, 11</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Sharp</i>, <i>thievish</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non fuit Autolyci tam piperata manus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					8, 59, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
